 ⚾️ Since I'm still basking in the Milwaukee Brewers' World Series triumph, I loved this advice from fellow Wisconsinite Jim VandeHei in his Axios C-Suite newsletter: Be like Pat Murphy . 

 Today's newsletter is 849 words, a 3-minute read. 

 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.5%.

